        "---\n",
        "title: \"Knowledge Graph Demo\"\n",
        "status: \"draft\"\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "The goal of this demo is to show a wayfinding approach that does **not** depend\n",
        "on hardwired URLs inside prose.\n",
        "\n",
        "Instead, pages declare a small amount of structured metadata:\n",
        "\n",
        "- a stable `id` (page identity)\n",
        "- `concepts` (what this page teaches/uses)\n",
        "- `prereq_concepts` (what this page assumes)\n",
        "\n",
        "A build script then generates a small knowledge graph (nodes + edges) and a\n",
        "resolver (page id → output href). Those artefacts can be used for:\n",
        "\n",
        "- computed “Related” panels\n",
        "- back-links (“where else is this concept used?”)\n",
        "- a site-wide concept index\n",
        "- graph views\n",
        "\n",
        "## Graph preview\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {style=\"display: none;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"}\n",
        "```{mermaid}\n",
        "graph LR\n",
        "  mermaid_runtime_trigger[\"Mermaid runtime trigger\"]\n",
        "```\n",
        ":::"
      ],
      "id": "07427068"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "#| output: asis\n",
        "\n",
        "import html\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "\n",
        "root = Path(\".\")\n",
        "mmd = (root / \"assets\" / \"graph\" / \"graph.mmd\").read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n",
        "print('<pre class=\"mermaid-js\"><code>')\n",
        "print(html.escape(mmd.rstrip()))\n",
        "print('</code></pre>')"
      ],
      "id": "938cc10d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
