      "source": [
        "## Generated artefacts\n",
        "\n",
        "- `assets/graph/graph.json` (nodes + edges)\n",
        "- `assets/graph/resolve.json` (page id → href)\n",
        "- `assets/graph/graph.mmd` (Mermaid view of a small slice)\n",
        "\n",
        "## Next step (if you like it)\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Add `id`, `concepts`, and `prereq_concepts` front matter to more pages (books\n",
        "   and main site).\n",
        "2. Expand `graph/concepts.yml` to include synonyms and short descriptions.\n",
        "3. Add a Quarto include that renders a “Connections” panel on each page from the\n",
        "   graph, rather than hand-linking prerequisites in prose."
